th issues, describing it as a rough time and feeling weighed down. Evan offers encouragement, stating Sam has support and emphasizing small joys during tough times.\n  - health challenges: Sam mentioned dealing with health issues lately, while Evan expressed that his new relationship is energizing after also dealing with health issues.\n  - strength and resilience: Evan got something that symbolizes strength and resilience because taking care of it motivates him to keep going through tough times.\n  - Evan: Evan mentioned his son had an accident last Tuesday after falling off his bike and is now doing better. He recently finished a contemporary figurative painting emphasizing emotional state.\n  - soccer accident: Evan's son had a soccer accident last Saturday, injuring his ankle. Evan has been looking after him and taking him to the doctor, finding it tough as a dad.\n  - Evan: Evan had a health scare last week involving a hospital visit due to a suspicious finding during a check-up, which turned out to be a misunderstanding.\n  - Evan: Evan plans to go hiking with Sam, focuses on fitness, has been at the gym gaining strength, and recently helped a lost tourist.\n  - Evan: Evan's old Prius broke down; he repaired and sold it, now owns a new Prius. He recently took his family on a road trip to Jasper, driving the Icefields Parkway.\n  - Evan: Evan is trying out new recipes, started taking painting classes recently, and is making changes to live healthier.\n  - Evan: Evan's new Prius broke down, causing stress as he relies on it for his active lifestyle and road trips, though he sees it as an opportunity to try new things.\n  - Evan: Evan mentioned a minor accident that dampened telling work friends about getting married; they have been very supportive.\n  - toddler: Evan is excited and nervous about becoming a parent again, noting it has been a while since he had a toddler around.\n  - Evan: Evan is doing easy exercises in physical therapy for a knee injury sustaine