 about her first one, which she had completed earlier. Additionally, she received encouragement from Nate, who advised her not to let rejections define her and to keep trying to find the perfect opportunity.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Joanna recently experienced a setback due to receiving a rejection from a production company. (event_time: 2022-10-21T14:01:00Z)\n  - A major company sent a rejection letter to Joanna after she finished her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna perceives the rejection (presumably the rejection letter mentioned previously) as a step back sometimes. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - The rejection letter from the major company greatly disappointed Joanna. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna might try acting if the opportunity arises. (event_time: 2022-04-21T19:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna received a generic rejection letter. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna may have experienced Rejections, possibly related to a film contest submission. (event_time: 2022-10-21T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna started writing another screenplay while waiting to hear back about the first one (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Nate advised Joanna not to let Rejections define her and to keep trying to find the perfect opportunity. (event_time: 2022-10-21T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes for new opportunities stemming from her completed screenplay. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - The rejection letter sent to Joanna contained little feedback. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - Nate asks Joanna if something happened regarding the major company rejection. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - Nate expressed sympathy to Joanna regarding rejection stinking. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna felt taken seriously after the producer meetings (event_time: 2022-11-04T15:56:00Z)\n  - Joanna tells Nate she will continue to do her best. (event_time: 2022-07-10T14:34:00Z)\n  - Nate inquired about the outcome of Joanna's audition. (event_time: 2022-03-24T13:43:00Z)\n  - Joanna is currently filming her own movie. (event_time: 2022-11-11T00:06:00Z)\n  - Producers liked the script pitched by Joanna (event_time: 2022-11-08T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna participated in an audition yesterday (event_time: 2022-03-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna cannot stop thinking about the screenplay (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends for producers to check out the screenplay (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna discussed her script during the producer meetings (event_time: 2022-11-04T15:56:00Z)\n  - Joanna felt confident discussing her script and vision during the producer meetings (event_time: 2022-11-04T15:56:00Z)\n  - Nate asked Joanna if she has any new plans for the screenplay. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Nate is asking Joanna about the next steps for her script (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Nate asks Joanna to let him know how the screenplay submission went. (event_time: 2022-06-24T10:55:00Z)\n  - The turtles will be ready to play with Joanna after Nate bathes them. (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends for directors to check out the screenplay (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Nate expressed hope that Joanna's screenplay would do well. (event_time: 2022-06-24T10:55:00Z)\n  - Joanna finds moments related to writing to be appreciated because of the positive recognition she is receiving (event_time: 2022-11-04T15:56:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most rel