_graph_1_qa_25","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What does Jon's dance studio offer?","golden_answer":"one-on-one metoring and training to dancers,  workshops and classes to local schools and centers","hypothesis":"Jon's dance studio offers dance classes, workshops, and one-on-one mentoring to help dancers of all ages and levels express themselves and reach their full potential. Additionally, it aims to be a supportive and encouraging space for young dancers.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Jon's studio provides a space for dancers of all ages and levels to express themselves. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Jon's studio helps dancers express themselves. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Jon's studio is giving dancers an outlet. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Jon is offering one-on-one mentoring and training in addition to dance classes and workshops. (event_time: 2023-06-13T20:29:00Z)\n  - Jon wants the dance studio to be a place of support and encouragement for all young dancers. (event_time: 2023-06-13T20:29:00Z)\n  - Jon's dance studio is bringing its best moves for an upcoming night of performances and judging. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Jon is involved with or runs the dance studio. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon's studio intends to welcome dancers of all ages and backgrounds. (event_time: 2023-07-23T18:46:00Z)\n  - Jon wants to use the dance studio to teach others the joy of dancing. (event_time: 2023-01-20T16:04:00Z)\n  - Jon i