e: Dave is restoring a Ford Mustang from a junkyard, working on car mods, and added a custom exhaust and performance upgrades to it. He attended a car show last Friday.\n  - Dave: Dave attended a car workshop in San Francisco to learn car restoration techniques. He also had a card night with friends last Friday and discussed his ongoing car restoration project with Calvin.\n  - Dave: Dave is fascinated by how machines work, starting at age ten after fixing an old car. He enjoys car engineering and transforming broken-down vehicles into high-running ones.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his album release and expressed enthusiasm for live music. Dave invited Calvin to see his cool cars in his garage.\n  - San Francisco: Dave recently returned from San Francisco, where he gained knowledge on car modification.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2070,"context_chars":8267,"retrieval_duration":0.18791818618774414,"response_duration":3.5153133869171143,"total_duration":3.7032315731048584,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer addresses the same core reason for Dave's visits to parks—relaxation and calmness—while providing additional context that aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides sufficient information to answer the question about why Dave regularly visits parks. It includes specific details that indicate he visits parks to relax and calm himself, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer. The facts mention that Dave explores parks on weekends to relax, finds being in nature calming, and considers his activities in nature as a way to cope with stress. Therefore, all necessary elements from the golden answer are present in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Dave h