to cars and making powerful models.\n  - cars: Dave believes attention to detail in vehicles makes a big impact, echoing his views on music. Calvin relates to stress from car servicing; Dave finds restoring cars fulfilling.\n  - long drives: Calvin enjoys long drives, remembering an amazing summer day with wind in his hair, feeling freedom, and appreciating his life's path, which made his hard work worthwhile. Dave later asks for the song name related to this experience.\n  - classic car: Calvin discussed restoring a classic car, which required skill and determination, to Dave.\n  - cars: Dave shared a picture of his latest car project, which Calvin found inspiring, contrasting it with Calvin's music endeavors. Dave finds working on cars therapeutic.\n  - teenagers: Calvin recalled freestyling with people when they were teenagers, referencing those days while feeling nostalgic.\n  - favorite activities: Calvin recharges and gets motivated by taking a break to engage in his favorite activities when facing setbacks.\n  - details: Dave wants Calvin to share details about meeting Frank Ocean, recording a song, and future plans when Calvin is available.\n  - fame: Calvin, inspired by a friend attending his performance, reflected on how relationships and being around certain people spark feelings from when he and friends talked about getting famous as teenagers.\n  - working on cars: Dave enjoys working on cars, as music helps him focus and feel great while doing it. Calvin finds repairing things fulfilling, similar to Dave's satisfaction with car work.\n  - opportunity: Calvin mentioned being greatly privileged to have been granted this opportunity, which he finds satisfying to bring back to life.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n  - car restoration: Dave restored and modified a car himself, adding a custom e