hared a picture of her cork board, which contains quotes, photos, and little keepsakes. Nate previously encouraged Joanna to take photos of her hike to a waterfall.\n  - gorgeous sunset: Joanna took a picture of a gorgeous sunset while hiking near Fort Wayne last summer; Nate asked what inspired the photo.\n  - green scenery: Joanna found amazing trails while hiking and took a photo that Nate admired for its dark sky and green scenery.\n  - experimenting in the kitchen: Nate discovered making coconut milk ice cream and enjoys experimenting in the kitchen, which Joanna agrees is fun.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from the road-trip script and asked about the coolest moment on set. He previously tried making coconut ice cream and had a game tournament pushed back.\n  - Nature: Joanna took a picture on a hike near Fort Wayne last summer. Nate later expressed appreciation for nature and mentioned getting a new friend for some critters.\n  - picture: Nate complimented Joanna's drawings, asking what inspired them. Joanna previously mentioned seeing her writing acted out and Nate complimented a hiking picture.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from her road-trip script, asked about the coolest on-set moment, and commented that her food looked yummy with nice colors and kick.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie and showed interest in the coolest moment on set. He also wished her well for her filming experience.\n  - Nate: Nate made homemade coconut ice cream with sprinkles. His game tournament was postponed, and he didn't make the finals. He creates YouTube gaming content. He expressed support for Joanna filming her movie.\n  - audience: Joanna advised Nate to watch other people's videos first to understand what his audience likes before posting his own.\n  - recipes: Joanna will bring some of her recipes to share desserts with Nate.\n  - explore new things: Joanna encouraged Nate to step outside his comfort zone and explore new things, stating the rewards can be great.\n  - Nate: Nate acquired a new family addition named Max and expressed pride in Joanna for staying strong and being true to herself.\n  - sprinkles: Nate used sprinkles in homemade coconut ice cream, which changed the dessert's color.\n  - frosting: Nate commented that the frosting looked really good and he loves the way it turned out.\n  - turtles: Nate finds turtles remind him to slow down and appreciate small things. Previously, Nate bathed his turtles and bought a third one for a large tank.\n  - Nate: Nate is an assistant who recently added a new family member named Max. He is communicating with Joanna about his busy week and Max.\n  - gaming videos: Joanna asked Nate what inspired him to start making gaming videos.\n  - Nate: Nate went to a game convention last Friday, met new people, and planned a gaming session with new friends who share his interests. Nate previously won a big video game tournament, earning money he plans to save.\n  - the trail: Joanna found an awesome, gorgeous hiking trail in her hometown. Nate is curious to see what the trail looks like and heard there is a nice trail just north of where he lives.\n  - creations: Joanna is proud of Nate's creations and complimented his gaming room. Nate is focusing on gaming and recently won a tournament.\n  - Nate: Nate enjoys the character Iron Man for his tech and humor. He keeps something in his room that reminds him to work on his goals. Previously, Nate enjoyed walking his dog Max and setting up dog playdates.\n  - Nate: Nate praised Joanna for setting up meetings with movie producers, comparing her success to winning a video game tournament, and expressed pride in her feeling hopeful and inspired.\n  - figure: Nate mentioned that Iron Man is his top pick and he has a figure of him. Joanna later asked Nate what made him get that figure.\n  - money: Nate is proud that he can make money doing what he loves after winning his fourth online video game tournament on Friday.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2008,"context_chars":7960,"retrieval_duration":0.3822445869445801,"response_duration":2.854861259460449,"total_duration":3.2371058464050293,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer does not mention the colorful bowls of coconut milk ice cream or any experimentation related to November 2022, making it incorrect.","completeness_grade":"INSUFFICIENT","completeness_reasoning":"The context does not contain any information about Nate sharing a photo of colorful bowls of coconut milk ice cream, which is the specific detail required to answer the question. While there are mentions of Nate experimenting in the kitchen and making coconut ice cream, there is no direct reference to him sharing a photo of it. Therefore, the critical information needed to answer the question is absent.","missing_elements":["Nate sharing a photo of colorful bowls of coconut milk ice cream"],"present_elements":["Nate experimenting in the kitchen","Nate making coconut ice cream"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_7","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_7_qa_154","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What feeling does Deborah get when she thinks about the time spent with her mom at their special spot?","golden_answer":"peace and gratitude","hypothesis":"Deborah feels peace and gratitude when she thinks about the time spent with her mom at their special spot. This is evidenced by her reflection on the memories associated with that place, where she cherishes the moments they shared together.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Deborah feels peace and gratitude when she goes back to this spot. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah considers their time together as a reminder of how special life is. (event_time: 2023-02-22T16:12:00Z)\n  - Deborah reflects on her mother's life at the spot by the water. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - Deborah felt grateful for the memories associated with the place (event_time: 2023-08-21T09:11:00Z)\n  - Deborah felt a mix of happy and sad emotions while hearing stories about her mom. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - Deborah is cherishing memories. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah spent time with her at this spot. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah found this place to be calming and nostalgic. (event_time: 2023-02-22T16:12:00Z)\n  - Deborah feels like she is still experiencing art shows with her mom. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - A special bench was located at Deborah's mom's house. (event_time: 2023-01-23T16:06:00Z)\n  - Deborah holds many special memories related to this place (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah is thankful for the time spent with someone. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah sometimes comes to sit on the bench to stay connected to her mom. (event_time: 2023-01-23T16:06:00Z)\n  - Jolene is asking Deborah about favorite memories with Deborah's mom at the spot. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah's mom's house had a special bench. (event_time: 2023-01-23T16:06:00Z)\n  - Deborah will always cherish her memories with her at this spot. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah spent time hanging out with nature at the yoga retreat. (event_time: 2023-08-17T00:00:00Z)\n  - Deborah has been thinking about the influence of her mom since she last spoke to Jolene. (event_time: 2023-08-26T17:33:00Z)\n  - Deborah and her mom would chat about life at this place (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah has memories of her mom singing lullabies to her. (event_time: 2023-09-20T10:17:00Z)\n  - Deborah has a mom. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - Deborah remembers the smell of her mom's special dish filling the house. (event_time: None)\n  - The house was one of Deborah's mother's favorite places. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah's mom loved to sit on the special bench every morning. (event_time: 2023-01-23T16:06:00Z)\n  - That spot Deborah visits is by the water near her mom's old house. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - The stories from her mom's old friends reminded Deborah how lucky she is to have had her mom. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - Jolene asked Deborah if Deborah has any little traditions she follows when reflecting on her mom. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - Jolene believes the moments Deborah spent with her mom's old friends must have been meaningful to Deborah. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - Deborah can feel her presence when she sits there (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah spent time at home. (event_time: 2023-09-08T19:39:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - place: Deborah visited her mom's house last month, a special place. She reconnected with her mom's friends there, hearing stories that brought up a mix of happy and sad emotions.\n  - spot: Deborah considers this spot a favorite place to ponder and let things go. Jolene meditates near this tranquil spot, which is associated with Deborah's memories of her mom's house.\n  - sunset: Deborah cherishes memories of watching a beautiful sunset in silence with Anna at a special spot, feeling peace and gratitude. Jolene previously shared a photo of a sunset over water in Bogota.\n  - that spot: That spot is near water, close to Deborah's mom's old house, a calm place for reflection on her mom's life and strength.\n  - mother's old house: Deborah visited her mother's old house last Sunday, sitting on a bench to feel her mother's presence. Jolene asked Deborah about special memories regarding her mother at the house.\n  - this place: Deborah visited \"this place\" where she sat on a bench, bringing back many emotions related to chats about dreams and life with her mom.\n  - memories: Deborah cherishes memories of her mom singing lullabies, recalling them as soothing, following her great time at a music festival.\n  - Moments: Deborah cherishes moments that evoke nostalgia, longing, and gratitude for memories, mentioning she brought flowers to a meaningful place.\n  - her memory: Deborah finds peace in keeping her mom's memory alive through art, which brings back powerful emotions and offers comfort after her loss.\n  - dreams: Jolene feels finishing a tough engineering project inspired her to keep striving for her dreams. Deborah recalls sharing dreams with her mom at a special place.\n  - stories about Deborah's mom: Deborah reconnected with her mom's old friends, and hearing stories about her mom was emotional, bringing a mix of happy and sad feelings, but overall comforting.\n  - mom's friends: Deborah reconnected with her mom's old friends, which was an emotional experience that brought up both happy and sad feelings, but was overall comforting.\n  - her presence: Deborah feels her mother's presence when sitting in a specific place, which comforts her during difficult times following her father's death.\n  - mom's house: Deborah visited her mom's house last month. It symbolizes her mom's strength and love, holding memories of good and bad times. Deborah's husband was photographed there.\n  - her: Deborah cherishes memories with 'her' at a spot where they watched a beautiful sunset; Deborah also carries an amulet belonging to 'her'. Jolene adopted 'her' two years ago for company.\n  - mom: Deborah's mom had a soothing voice and sang lullabies to her. Deborah cherishes th